url: "https://github.com/<your-github-username>/ai-pbpk-adme-predictor"
abstract: >
  An open-source platform for Caco-2 permeability classification from molecular
  structure, with confidence scoring, applicability-domain checks, batch screening,
  descriptor-based interpretation, and educational PK/NCA sensitivity simulation.
  Built on the TDC Caco2_Wang public benchmark. Not for clinical or regulatory use.
